    191 U00bc							; Bomb X/Y/timer live at $F6/$F7 + BombY=$85 (see top of ZP map)
    192 U00bc		       00 f6	   BombX      =	$F6	; bomb drop X (RoomX snapshot; bank1 does not write $F6)
