   1756  f4fb							; TallyArm (bank2, via TallyTramp) snapshots time/bombs/lives into
   1757  f4fb							; TallyTicks and sets DropTarget=$FE; each frame's dispatch then runs
   1758  f4fb							; TallyWork, whose done path does the old tail (level++/LoadLevel/bar).
   1759  f4fb		       20 e6 ff 	      jsr	TallyTramp
   1760  f4fe				   .CMPDone
   1761  f4fe		       60		      rts
