   1764  f4ff							; SelectActiveObject MOVED to bank2 (C1, 2026-10-20) — body at $F486, entered
   1765  f4ff							; by CallPad_SelectObject (corridor pad at $FC1D: `sta $1FF8`); the `jmp` half
   1766  f4ff							; lives in bank2 at $FC20. Why: the bank0 flow is the scarce resource — the
   1767  f4ff							; move frees the 289 B body + the 16 B colour/offset tables (flow tail 14 ->
   1768  f4ff							; 319 B) and removes one FoldIndirect (25c, 2 switches) and one
   1769  f4ff							; CallPad_IsRoomDark per object draw, because the enemy records live in bank2.
   1770  f4ff							; Behaviour, ZP outputs and the SetObjectXPos/SetObjReflection/ObjTop contract
   1771  f4ff							; are unchanged; the VBL work window DROPS by ~44c (sim_frame_budget).
