   2978  fcf3							; No beam on the title: band 0 is the CAVE .Line now, which re-enables
   2979  fcf3							; ENAM0 from BeamMask & LaserState. Clear held+gate (b7/b1) only —
   2980  fcf3							; LASER_KEEP keeps b0 and the rooms 4-7 dark mask, so a dark-room
   2981  fcf3							; preview still renders dark.
