   3214  fdde							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3215  fdde							; PlayerWalkA/B — dedicated ground-walk frames (sprites.png 2026-10-03,
   3216  fdde							; extracted pixel-exact; torso rows 0-6 identical to the jet pair).
   3217  fdde							;   A = boots apart (stride, rows 10-11 spread to cols 2+6 / 1+6)
   3218  fdde							;   B = boots together (passing pose, rows 10-11 = cols 3+4)
   3219  fdde							; Legs rows 7-9 identical in both — only the boots move. Standing forces
   3220  fdde							; PlayerSpriteA; walk cycle alternates A<->B every 8 frames (EnemyRamP&$08,
   3221  fdde							; 16-frame full cycle) while grounded + L/R held.
   3222  fdde							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3223  fdde				   PlayerWalkA
